   "description": "Chassis only - what you spec before deciding what goes in it. The 10 slot bays are EMPTY; psus, res, sfbs are populated. Enough to power on and reach the box, which is the question most people ask first and the one `default` used to answer with whatever the drawing happened to be populated with.",
