   "source": "derived - built from the group roles rather than from a vendor bundle: every bay whose group is `service` or `management` keeps its seat, every `traffic` bay takes a blank. This vendor publishes no base configuration for this chassis, so the library defines one. Where a vendor DOES publish one, follow it instead and say so here."
